==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|24px]] '''Silk CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' command creates a blended multi corner surface, a CubicNStarSurface_NStar66 object, from a [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGridNStar66|blended multi corner grid]].

[[File:23.-CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.png|300px]]

{{Caption|The finished N-star surface filling a multi-sided corner}}


[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66-02.png|200px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|16px|link=]]
[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66-01.png|200px]]

{{Caption|An N6 [[Silk_ControlGridNStar66|blended corner grid]] → Resulting N6 blended corner surface}}

==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGridNStar66|blended multi corner grid]].
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] CubicNStarSurface_NStar66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] CubicNStarSurface_NStar66}} option from the menu.
# A blended multi corner surface, a '''CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' object, is created.

==Notes==

* This tool is intended to fill a corner gap surrounded by several blended edge surfaces.
* If eliminating pinching in poor corner geometry is required, the [[Image:Silk_StarTrim CubicNStar.svg|16px]] [[Silk_StarTrim CubicNStar|Silk_StarTrim CubicNStar]] tool may be helpful.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A blended multi corner surface, a '''CubicNStarSurface_NStar66''' object is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|CubicNStarSurface_NStar66}}

* {{PropertyData|NStarGrid|Link}}: Control grid star.
* {{PropertyData|NSurf|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: N Cubic Surfaces.


